    "Stop All sends `stop` to every running server, so each one saves and exits normally. Servers started by a previous app session have no console to talk to — those are left alone.\n\nTerminate All kills the processes instead (SIGTERM, then SIGKILL). Recent world changes may be lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部停止会向每个运行中的服务器发送 `stop`，让它们正常存档并退出。由上一次应用会话启动的服务器没有可用的控制台 —— 这些实例会被保留。\n\n全部终止则直接结束进程（先 SIGTERM，再 SIGKILL）。最近的世界改动可能会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止服务器"
          }
        }
