        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除全部实例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete all %lld instance folders?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除全部 %lld 个实例目录？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No instances yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有任何实例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a launch target above and press Start — the folder and its cards appear here once created.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在上面选好启动目标并按启动 —— 目录建好后，对应的卡片会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch launch target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换启动目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Focus version search": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聚焦版本搜索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Priority and conflicts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "优先级与冲突"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OrzMC 处于活跃状态时，应用内快捷键先于文本输入生效；正在用输入法拼写时一律让位给候选词。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OrzMC 处于活跃状态时，应用内快捷键先于文本输入生效；正在用输入法拼写时一律让位给候选词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统快捷键（⌘Space、⌃↑ 等）和其它 App 注册的全局热键会在系统层先被拦下，本应用收不到——某条快捷键没反应时，先去「系统设置 → 键盘 → 快捷键」查是否被占用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统快捷键（⌘Space、⌃↑ 等）和其它 App 注册的全局热键会在系统层先被拦下，本应用收不到——某条快捷键没反应时，先去「系统设置 → 键盘 → 快捷键」查是否被占用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Console page: back to detail": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制台页：返回详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close Window (settings, console)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭窗口（设置、控制台）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete %@ Client Files?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除 %@ 客户端文件？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "this version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop: each server saves the world, then shuts down. Players are disconnected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止：逐个先存档再退出，玩家会掉线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminate: processes are killed at once, so recent changes may be lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终止：直接结束进程，最近的进度可能丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloads and runs the official installer:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会下载并运行官方安装器："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installs to ~/.local/bin (no admin rights) and may add it to your shell PATH.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装到 ~/.local/bin（无需管理员权限），可能修改 shell 的 PATH。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reinstalling rewrites the install record: it will say this app installed it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重装会改写安装记录：来源会变成「由本应用安装」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server saves and shuts down; connected players are disconnected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器会存档并关闭，在线玩家会掉线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server restarts; players are disconnected during the restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器会重启，期间玩家掉线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes the binary, the PATH line it added, the shell completion and the install record. Game files are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会删除可执行文件、它写入的 PATH 行、命令补全和安装记录；游戏文件保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ server folder (%@) is deleted for good, including worlds, configs and plugins.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会永久删除 %@ 服务端目录（%@），存档、配置和插件一并消失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ client folder (%@) is deleted for good, including assets, mods and options.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会永久删除 %@ 客户端目录（%@），资源、mods 和设置一并消失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All %lld instance folders (%@) are deleted for good, including worlds, configs, plugins and assets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会永久删除 %@ 的全部 %lld 个实例目录，含存档、配置、插件与资源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ server saves the world, then shuts down; connected players are disconnected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 服务端会先存档再退出，在线玩家会掉线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ server restarts; players are disconnected during the restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 服务端会重启，期间玩家掉线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ server is killed immediately and cannot finish saving; recent changes may be lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 服务端会被立即结束，来不及存档，最近的进度可能丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The input isn't valid. Check the settings and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入不合法，请检查设置后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Network request failed. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络请求失败，请检查网络后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The requested version or file doesn't exist. Refresh the list and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本或文件不存在，刷新列表后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-in failed. Complete the Microsoft sign-in again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录失败，请重新完成 Microsoft 登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version or platform doesn't support that action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个版本或平台不支持该操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading or writing files failed. Check free space and permissions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读写文件失败，请检查磁盘空间和权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancelled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something went wrong while running the game or server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行游戏/服务端时出错。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld more": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另 %lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "(no output)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（没有输出）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Server Address…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加服务器地址…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the server status now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即检查服务器状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Commands and replies show up here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令和返回会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect a server you run yourself": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接你自己运行的服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Console (RCON)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制台（RCON）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the RCON password, or turn RCON off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请填写 RCON 密码，或者关掉 RCON。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the address and port of a Minecraft server you host (for example one started with `orzmc` in server mode). The app checks its status with Server List Ping; turn on RCON to run console commands.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填写你自己服务器（比如用 `orzmc` 服务端模式起的那个）的地址和端口。本应用用 Server List Ping 查状态；想发控制台命令就再打开 RCON。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the server address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请填写服务器地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My Server": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我的服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional, e.g. Home": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选，例如「家里的」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port must be a number between 1 and 65535.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端口必须是 1–65535 之间的数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ports and the password come from `server.properties` (`rcon.port`, `rcon.password`, `enable-rcon=true`). The password is stored in the system keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端口和密码来自 `server.properties` 的 `rcon.port` / `rcon.password` / `enable-rcon=true`。密码保存在系统钥匙串里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RCON answered in an unexpected format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RCON 返回了无法识别的格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RCON needs a password. Add it in Settings to send commands.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RCON 需要密码，先在设置里填好才能发命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RCON password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RCON 密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RCON password is missing. Add it in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缺少 RCON 密码，请在设置里填写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RCON password was rejected. Check the password in server.properties.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RCON 密码被拒绝，请核对 server.properties 里的密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RCON port": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RCON 端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RCON port must be a number between 1 and 65535.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RCON 端口必须是 1–65535 之间的数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
