        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server answered in an unexpected format. Is it a Minecraft server?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务端返回了无法识别的数据，确认这是 Minecraft 服务器吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server closed the connection. Check that the port belongs to Minecraft, not another service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务端断开了连接，确认这个端口确实是 Minecraft，而不是别的服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server returned status data this app doesn't understand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个服务端返回的状态数据本应用无法识别。"
